---
kind: scene
id: sefa.chartDone
title: Sefa, after the chart
on: talk
target: npc.sefa
once: run
priority: 10
when: "quest.sefaChart.state == 'complete'"
---

## Chart table

@sefa{code="0010" emotion="content"}: I've started a second copy. For the next heir. There's always a next heir.
<match on="user.deepest">
  <when is="6..">
    @sefa{code="0020"}: You've been deeper than the chart goes, you know. Chamber {{user.deepest}}. Tell me about it sometime.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @sefa{code="0030"}: Everything down to the throne, inked and dry.
  </otherwise>
</match>
